# FORK POLICY (see FORK.md)
#
# This fork keeps its own trimmed-down CI pipeline. During upstream syncs,
# whenever both sides changed pipeline.yml, automatically keep OUR version
# instead of producing a merge conflict.
#
# Requires the "ours" merge driver to be configured:
#   git config merge.ours.driver true
# (The sync-upstream workflow does this automatically; set it locally too if
# you merge upstream by hand.)
.github/workflows/pipeline.yml merge=ours
